# PsicologIA Project Rules

## Frontend & Design
- **Branding Fidelity**: Strictly use project branding colors (Bronze, Espresso, Silk, Cream).
- **Custom UI**: Navigation and selection components (dropdowns, selectors) MUST have custom-styled options. No default `<select>` or native dropdowns without custom overlays.
- **PWA/Mobile**: Follow Mobile Design System principles. All UI must be optimized for touch and low-latency mobile interaction.

## Code Quality
- **Component Reuse**: Scan for existing components before creating new ones. Re-utilize UI primitives from `@/components/ui`.
- **API Consistency**: Follow the established pattern of feature-based API modules (e.g., `agendaApi`, `patientsApi`).
